mosfet: an NMOS (sp_mos1, SPICE level 1) with a resistor load, its drain swept by the gate
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/mos1.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model nmod sp_mos1 vto=0.7 kp=100u lambda=0.02
vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=3.0
vg (g 0) vsource dc=0.0
rd (vdd d) resistor r=10k
m1 (d g 0 0) nmod w=10u l=2u
control
  sweep s1 instance="vg" parameter="dc" from=0.0 to=3.0 step=0.1
  analysis dc1 op
endc
